<title>HONG KONG: Trade in Chun Wo shares suspended.</title>
<headline>Trade in Chun Wo shares suspended.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-05-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Trading in shares of construction firm Chun Wo Holdings Ltd was suspended on Monday at the company's request pending an announcement, the Hong Kong stock exchange said.  </p>
<p>The company's shares closed at HK$2.425, up HK$0.20, on Friday.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong newsroom (852) 2843 6369</p>
